"entity": {
"name": "TAG Immobilien AG",
"description": "TAG Immobilien AG engages in the acquisition, development, and management of residential real estate. It operates through the following segments: Rental Germany, Rental Poland, Sale Poland, and Other. The Rental Germany segment is associated into the regions of Berlin, Chemnitz, Dresden, Erfurt, Gera, Hamburg, Leipzig, Rhine-Ruhr, Rostock, Salzgitter and others. The Rental Poland segment includes not only rental activities but also the development of residential properties intended for rental in the future, as well as revenues from services provided in connection with rental. The Sale Poland segment comprises the sale of apartments and the development of real estate. The Other segment mainly composes of sales activities in Germany. The company was founded in 1882 and is headquartered in Hamburg, Germany.",
